---
import { REPO_URL, STALLION } from '../config';
---
<footer class="site-footer scene">
  <div class="wrap site-footer__grid">
    <div>
      <p class="site-footer__brand"><img src="img/logo-n-96.webp" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" />Explore<span>NDMU</span></p>
      <p class="t-small" style="max-width:30em;margin-top:1rem">An augmented reality campus tour, navigation and information app for Notre Dame of Marbel University, Koronadal City. A BS Information Technology capstone project.</p>
      <p class="t-small" style="margin-top:1rem;display:flex;gap:1.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="link" href="research.html">Research</a><a class="link" href={REPO_URL} rel="noopener">Source on GitHub</a></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="site-footer__h">Credits</h2>
      <ul class="site-footer__list t-small">
        <li>Bronze Stallion 3D model: <a class="link" href={STALLION.url} rel="noopener">“{STALLION.title}”</a> by <a class="link" href={STALLION.authorUrl} rel="noopener">{STALLION.author}</a> (Sketchfab), <a class="link" href={STALLION.licenceUrl} rel="noopener license">{STALLION.licence}</a>. Shown on this site only as an unmodified render.</li>
        <li>Fonts: Instrument Serif and Inter, SIL Open Font License.</li>
        <li>Icons: Flaticon UIcons, regular rounded.</li>
        <li>Film: narration voice by ElevenLabs (Sarah). Original score and sound design made for the film. Film fonts: Poppins and Inter, SIL Open Font License.</li>
        <li>App voice: ElevenLabs (Matilda), generated ahead of time and stored in the app.</li>
        <li>Route data: walked and recorded on the NDMU campus by the team.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap site-footer__base t-small">
    <p>ExploreNDMU is a student project, not an official Notre Dame of Marbel University service.</p>
    <p>Free to use. No account, no payment.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style is:global>
  .site-footer { padding: clamp(3rem, 8vh, 5rem) 0 calc(6rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px)); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line); background: rgb(255 253 246 / 0.82); }
  .site-footer__grid { display: grid; gap: 2.5rem; }
  @media (min-width: 56rem) { .site-footer__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.25fr; gap: 4rem; } }
  .site-footer__brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.7rem; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-forest); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .site-footer__brand span { color: var(--color-gold-deep); }
  .site-footer__h { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0; color: var(--color-ink); }
  .site-footer__list { margin: 0.9rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 0.55rem; max-width: 46em; }
  .site-footer__base { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 0.5rem 2rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; padding-top: 1.25rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line); }
</style>
